                <invention-title lang="de">INTELLIGENTE AGENTEN ZUR VERWALTUNG VON DATEN IM ZUSAMMENHANG MIT DREIDIMENSIONALEN OBJEKTEN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">AGENTS INTELLIGENTS POUR GÉRER DES DONNÉES ASSOCIÉES À DES OBJETS TRIDIMENSIONNELS</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">INTELLIGENT AGENTS FOR MANAGING DATA ASSOCIATED WITH THREE-DIMENSIONAL OBJECTS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method for managing data associated with real-world objects and virtual objects displayed in a communication session, comprising: receiving, at a computing device, sensor data generated by a depth map sensor, the sensor data comprising depth map data defining a three-dimensional model of the real-world objects positioned within a real-world environment; receiving model data defining the virtual objects for display within a view of the real-world objects and the real-world environment; generating data defining a plurality of agent instances, the individual agent instances having an associated database for individual virtual objects or individual real-world objects of interest of the real-world objects that are identified by an analysis of the model data, the depth map data; monitoring communication data of a plurality of users of the communication session for identifying keywords, descriptions or parameters to be stored within individual databases of the individual agent instance associated with the individual virtual objects of interest or the individual real-world objects of interest ; and persistently storing data defining the keywords, the descriptions, or the parameters within the individual databases of the individual agent instances associated with the individual virtual objects or the individual real-world objects of interest for access by remote computing devices participating in multiple communication sessions.</p>
            </abstract>
